{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-artcraft#card-zh","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","commit":"2d22bc516852b31d587ae95a5ec0772b190e9f58","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ArtCraft Bridge 是一个面向 DSH 网页客户端的创作软件自动化插件，通过工具和同源 HTTP API 将 ArtCraft 家族应用接入 Harness。它可以检查 CLI 安装状态、运行应用命令、向运行中的应用发送控制通道指令，并提供文件读写、应用能力目录、处理配方和交付质量检查。长时间渲染等任务可通过后台任务接口启动、查询和取消；另有独立技能提供者加载随包技能。适合希望在 DSH 对话或自建前端中编排图像、视频、音频及文档应用的用户。需要本机安装对应 ArtCraft 应用及 CLI，并按需配置其路径；文件操作由调用者指定绝对路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1068-1090","index.js:1196-1314","index.js:1386-1502","skills.js:20-60"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-artcraft#card-en","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","commit":"2d22bc516852b31d587ae95a5ec0772b190e9f58","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ArtCraft Bridge connects creative apps to DSH through agent tools and an HTTP API. It runs app CLIs, controls supported running apps, and provides file operations and delivery checks. Frontends can start and track background jobs. Install the relevant apps and CLIs locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1068-1090","index.js:1196-1314","index.js:1386-1502","skills.js:20-60"]}
