{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-artcraft#feature-1","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","commit":"2d22bc516852b31d587ae95a5ec0772b190e9f58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArtCraft Bridge 的功能「运行应用 CLI」：通过 artcraft_cli 选择家族应用并传入命令行参数，返回运行结果；长时间任务可交由 HTTP 后台任务接口处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1090-1112","index.js:1472-1502"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-artcraft#feature-2","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","commit":"2d22bc516852b31d587ae95a5ec0772b190e9f58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArtCraft Bridge 的功能「控制运行中的应用」：向支持的 JSON 控制通道发送方法与参数，取得应用返回结果；可选择预设应用端口或指定端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1114-1136","index.js:310-340"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-artcraft#feature-3","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","commit":"2d22bc516852b31d587ae95a5ec0772b190e9f58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArtCraft Bridge 的功能「浏览器后台任务」：前端可提交应用与参数启动任务，再查询任务状态或取消任务，适用于耗时渲染和批处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1472-1502"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-artcraft#feature-4","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","commit":"2d22bc516852b31d587ae95a5ec0772b190e9f58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArtCraft Bridge 的功能「交付质检」：对指定产物运行应用探针并按可选平台和类型核对规则，返回检查项、判定及修复提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:568-670","index.js:1314-1340"]}
